{
  "name": "dsh-remembers",
  "version": "1.2.1",
  "description": "情感陪伴向的 DSH 记忆插件：分层记忆 + 人格注入 + 学说话语料库，附「她的记忆」面板（记忆/人格/表情包/主动消息/B站/贴吧/QQ/学说话/服务）。后端是独立的 Python 服务（SQLite）。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "index.mjs",
  "icon": "icon.png",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.mjs",
    "./client": "./client.js",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "index.mjs",
    "client.js",
    "client.mjs",
    "config.mjs",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "install.mjs",
    "install.sh",
    "install.ps1",
    "icon.png",
    "locale/*.json",
    "docs/*.md",
    "docs/**/*.md",
    "tools/tone.js",
    "tools/tieba/*",
    "service/*.py",
    "service/schema.sql",
    "service/seeds.json",
    "service/requirements.txt",
    "service/Dockerfile",
    "service/docker-compose.yml",
    "service/README.md",
    "service/static/*",
    "service/deploy/*",
    "README.md",
    "README.en.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web"
    }
  },
  "_peerRangeNote": "用 * 而不是版本范围：npm 的预发布匹配规则要求范围里存在同元组且带预发布标签的比较符，否则像 0.2.1-rc.2 这样的宿主版本会被静默排除（用户侧表现为 ERESOLVE）。本插件只用到 dsh-llm 的 createUserMessage 和 dsh-tools 的 defineTool，DSH 加载插件时也会自己检查 peer，所以这里不设上限，把兼容判断交给宿主。",
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-llm": "*",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-tools": "*"
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": "^22.19.0 || >=24"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "test": "node tests/node/test_plugin.mjs && node tests/node/test_client.mjs && node tests/node/tone.test.mjs"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "memory",
    "long-term-memory",
    "companion",
    "persona",
    "bm25",
    "rag"
  ],
  "license": "MIT"
}
